rules:
  - Scan Content and Improvement before broad work.
  - Use accepted intake as site content, roadmap input, manifest design input, or implementation evidence.
  - Record disposition, proof of use, and final active-intake state in .uai/intake-outcome-ledger.uai.
  - Remove processed source-site copies unless a human keeps them active.
completion_gate: Active buckets must be empty or placeholder-only after processing.
